OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after stabbing at Sutton
OL,4,AColdfield pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being stabbed at a
OL,7,Fpub in Sutton Coldfield.
OL,9,FThe victim, in his 20s, was found in
OL,10,Fthe car park of the Beggars Bush pub,
OL,11,Fon Chester Road, just before 02:00 BST
OL,12,Fon Sunday. He was confirmed dead at the
OL,13,Fscene.
OL,15,FA murder investigation has been
OL,16,Flaunched and officers have begun to
OL,17,Freview CCTV and speak to witnesses.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
