OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after stabbing at Sutton
OL,4,AColdfield pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large number of people are believed
OL,7,Fto have been at the venue for an event,
OL,8,FWest Midlands Police said, and anyone
OL,9,Fwith information has been asked to come
OL,10,Fforward.
